        "state": "value_present",
        "value": {
          "kind": "record_fields",
          "fields": {
            "summary": "Milton Keynes offered a practical AI workshop and interactive demonstrations in 2024. Better understanding, confidence, and feedback remain intended benefits without measured changes.",
            "account": "The festival included Code For Her's October 29, 2024 workshop, where participants could use and build AI on their own laptops. The Smart City Experience Centre opened on November 1 with interactive AI applications and robots, including Pepper for visitor information and entertainment. The host aimed to improve public understanding and confidence and gather feedback for technology providers. The accounts provide no measurements of changes in learning, anxiety, or product quality. Civic outcomes from the separate hackathon are unspecified."
          }
        },
